      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Absorb Force",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "force"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\nTrigger A Force Barrage is fired at Usilket, and they are aware of it and have a free hand\n\n---\n\nEffect Usilket \"catches\" the missile, absorbing it and causing that hand to glow while it holds this energy. A hand that's holding energy can only be used for Force Bolt. The energy lasts for 6 rounds or until it is released.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Attack of Opportunity",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Flurry of Blows",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "flourish"
      ],
      "text": "Usilket makes two Strikes with their fist or with a monk weapon. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purpose of resistances and weaknesses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Force Bolt",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "1 to 3\n\n---\nUsilket fires two Force Barrage per action spent, dealing 1d4+1 force damage each. They can't spend more actions on this ability than they have free hands. If they use a hand that has Absorbed Force, that hand hurls three missiles instead of two, expending the held energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Meditative Therapy",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "healing"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\n\nEffect One of Usilket's most unusual abilities is a technique they learned during a long visit to Jalmeray. Usilket enters a trancelike state for 10 minutes, during which they can attempt to remove a disease or one of the following conditions: Clumsy, Drained, Enfeebled, or Stupefied. To remove the disease or condition, Usilket must counteract the disease or condition with a Medicine check. Usilket can attempt to counteract a disease or condition present in another creature, as long as that creature remains adjacent to the witchwyrd during the entire meditation.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "day"
      }
    },
